### 剪贴板示例
```csharp
if (IsGuiEvent && GuiEventName == "clicked")
{
    RuntimeGuiControl? textbox = Scene.GetGuiControl("PromptInput");
    if (textbox is not null && textbox.HasSelection)
    {
        Input.SetClipboardText(textbox.SelectedText);
    }
}

